// Regicide - the Tyras Camp quartermaster's stock. Optional flavour the walkthrough mentions in
// passing ("optionally buy bread from the camp shopkeeper"); the npc was placed at m34_49 (18,4)
// with a Talk-to option and no shop behind it.
//
// Stocked as an army quartermaster rather than a general store: field rations and the few tools a
// camp on the far side of Isafdar would actually issue. Nothing here is needed for the quest - the
// bomb's materials come from the Poison Waste and from Lord Iorwerth.
[regicide_tyras_shop]
scope=shared
size=40
restock=yes
stackall=yes
allstock=no
stock1=bread,15,100
stock2=cooked_meat,10,100
stock3=cooked_chicken,10,100
stock4=beer,10,200
stock5=tinderbox,3,500
stock6=rope,3,200
stock7=bucket_empty,5,50
stock8=pot_empty,5,50
